{"id":"e585861c4ee3b135","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-resolution-system.md","title":"Resolution System","display":"df-resolution-system — Resolution System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-resolution-system","aliases":["72-df-resolution-system"],"display":"df-resolution-system — Resolution System","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, sections 2.2-2.3 and 8.3; printed pp. 550-551, 598; PDF pp. 562-563, 610","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-resolution-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-resolution-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-resolution-system — Resolution System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, sections 2.2-2.3 and 8.3; printed pp. 550-551, 598; PDF pp. 562-563, 610"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a,\\operatorname{enc}\">\\(\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a,\\operatorname{enc}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的有限子集全体。</li>\n<li>下文输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的类型为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Clause})\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Clause})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 为有限子句序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_1,C_2\\in\\mathsf{Clause}\">\\(C_1,C_2\\in\\mathsf{Clause}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\">\\(l\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 大于每个自然数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\pi|\">\\(|\\pi|\\)</span> 是序列编码位数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\)</span> 是序列项数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lit}=\\mathsf{PV}\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Clause}=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Lit}),\\qquad\n\\overline p=\\neg p,\\quad\\overline{\\neg p}=p\\quad(p\\in\\mathsf{PV}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Lit}=\\mathsf{PV}\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Clause}=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Lit}),\\qquad\n\\overline p=\\neg p,\\quad\\overline{\\neg p}=p\\quad(p\\in\\mathsf{PV}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}(C_1,C_2,l)=(C_1\\setminus\\{l\\})\\cup(C_2\\setminus\\{\\overline l\\})\n\\quad(l\\in C_1,\\ \\overline l\\in C_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Res}(C_1,C_2,l)=(C_1\\setminus\\{l\\})\\cup(C_2\\setminus\\{\\overline l\\})\n\\quad(l\\in C_1,\\ \\overline l\\in C_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)&gt;0\n\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\pi_i\\in F\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\;\\exists l\\in\\pi_j\\;\n(\\overline l\\in\\pi_k\\land\\pi_i=\\operatorname{Res}(\\pi_j,\\pi_k,l))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)&gt;0\n\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\pi_i\\in F\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\;\\exists l\\in\\pi_j\\;\n(\\overline l\\in\\pi_k\\land\\pi_i=\\operatorname{Res}(\\pi_j,\\pi_k,l))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}(F)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi):\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\\},&amp;\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F),\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;\\neg\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}(F)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi):\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\\},&amp;\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F),\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;\\neg\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_{\\mathrm{Res}}(F)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\\},&amp;\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F),\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;\\neg\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_{\\mathrm{Res}}(F)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\\},&amp;\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F),\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;\\neg\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，§8.3，印刷页 598，PDF 页 610；编码大小与行数的区分见 §2.2–2.3，印刷页 550–551，PDF 页 562–563。</li>\n<li>修正了推导步骤中未重新检查主文字及其补文字的缺口；补文字操作也明确处理负文字。输入统一为有限子句集合，与 PHP 原子一致。</li>\n<li>本次核对了归结规则及反驳陈述；对任一赋值，两个父子句都真时归结子句必真。因而有归结反驳的子句集合不可满足。没有在此证明归结完备性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a,\\operatorname{enc}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]；$\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)$ 表示 $X$ 的有限子集全体。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a,\\operatorname{enc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Clause})","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"C_1,C_2\\in\\mathsf{Clause}","display":false},{"tex":"l\\in\\mathsf{Lit}","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"|\\pi|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Lit}=\\mathsf{PV}\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Clause}=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Lit}),\\qquad\n\\overline p=\\neg p,\\quad\\overline{\\neg p}=p\\quad(p\\in\\mathsf{PV}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Res}(C_1,C_2,l)=(C_1\\setminus\\{l\\})\\cup(C_2\\setminus\\{\\overline l\\})\n\\quad(l\\in C_1,\\ \\overline l\\in C_2).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&\n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{<\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)>0\n\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\pi_i\\in F\\lor\\exists j,k<i\\;\\exists l\\in\\pi_j\\;\n(\\overline l\\in\\pi_k\\land\\pi_i=\\operatorname{Res}(\\pi_j,\\pi_k,l))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}(F)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi):\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\\},&\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F),\\\\\n\\infty,&\\neg\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F),\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"s_{\\mathrm{Res}}(F)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\\},&\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F),\\\\\n\\infty,&\\neg\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F).\n\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":2882,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-system|df-resolution-system — Resolution System]]"},{"id":"a7ea013f9a55dcda","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Lit},\\mathsf{Clause}$ 及补文字 $\\overline l$ 取 [[72-df-resolution-system]]。$F$ 为有限子句集合，$C\\in\\mathsf{Clause}$。"},{"id":"a06ff8011d8167f1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F$ 是有限子句集合；$V$ 为有限命题变量集合，$V(F)\\subseteq V$。$D,r,\\mathcal G$ 取 [[72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses]]，$\\operatorname{ResRefutation}$ 取 [[72-df-resolution-system]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-resolution-system|df-resolution-system — Resolution System]]"},{"id":"1aa3ad8d378fa3a5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]；$A,B$ 遍历有限子句集合，$\\operatorname{ResRefutation}$ 如 [[72-df-resolution-system]]。"},{"id":"0bef01f8f19e158b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s_{\\mathrm{Res}}$、$\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}$ 及固定编码如 [[72-df-resolution-system]]；通常 PHP 子句集合 $\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n$ 如 [[72-thm-php-resolution-lower]]，这里只复用该节点的显式 CNF 定义，不使用其强下界的证明。"},{"id":"53a60483631f158b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Clause}$、$\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}$ 如 [[72-df-resolution-system]]；$c\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}$，$n_0\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"bab5de7961748d5b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}$ 如 [[72-df-resolution-system]]；$\\omega$ 包含 $0$。"},{"id":"21921243c3156e00","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F,\\mathsf{Asn},\\operat